---
import { Heart, Cpu } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<footer class="main-footer">
  <div class="container footer-content">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <div class="logo-footer">
        <span class="logo-text">Agent<span class="text-gradient">Hub</span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="brand-desc">
        AI 에이전트 스킬, MCP 도구, 플러그인을 위한 오픈소스 레지스트리입니다.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer-links">
      <div class="link-group">
        <h4>탐색</h4>
        <a href="/">디렉토리</a>
        <a href="/submit">스킬 등록</a>
      </div>
      <div class="link-group">
        <h4>커뮤니티</h4>
        <a href="https://github.com/jeongsk/agenthub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MCP 스펙</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <p class="copyright">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} AgentHub. 
      <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-stack-link">Astro</a> & 
      <a href="https://pages.cloudflare.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-stack-link">Cloudflare Pages</a>로 구동됩니다.
    </p>
    <p class="made-with">
      <Heart size={12} class="heart-icon" /> 에이전트 시대를 위해 만들어졌습니다.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .main-footer {
    background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.6);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 60px 0 30px 0;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .footer-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  .logo-text {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .brand-desc {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .link-group h4 {
    color: hsl(var(--text-primary));
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .link-group a {
    display: block;
    color: hsl(var(--text-secondary));
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .link-group a:hover {
    color: hsl(var(--cyan-point));
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding-top: 30px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    color: hsl(var(--text-muted));
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .footer-stack-link {
    color: hsl(var(--text-secondary));
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .footer-stack-link:hover {
    color: white;
  }

  .made-with {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .heart-icon {
    color: hsl(var(--rose-point));
    fill: hsl(var(--rose-point));
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
